            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "Hedge Funds Scooped Up Spot Bitcoin ETFs in Q1, Filings Show",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "- 13-F filings show hedge funds Point72 and Citadel added to holdings of IBIT, the largest spot bitcoin ETF. - Citadel, founded by billionaire Ken Griffin, also owns spot Bitcoin ETFs ARKB, BITB and others. - Griffin\u2019s Citadel sold massive holdings of SPY in Q1.",
